000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. FLOAT2.
000300* Floating point, second set (#40): mixed fixed and floating
000400* expressions, the conversion's rounding (nearest, an exact half
000500* toward zero, as IBM's), DISPLAY of several magnitudes, ** edge
000600* cases, SIZE ERROR on a negative base to a fraction and on
000700* division by zero. Expected output recorded from IBM ANS COBOL on
000800* TK5 except the departures docs/COBOL74-CONFORMANCE.md lists:
000900* floating evaluation (A, B, E, F, I), zero's exponent (R), the
001000* digits of 0.001 (Q), (-8) ** 3 as -512 and a SIZE ERROR for (-8)
001100* ** 0.5 where IBM computes with |x| (X, Y).
001200 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001300 DATA DIVISION.
001400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001500 01  F1  COMP-2 VALUE 0.
001600 01  F2  COMP-2 VALUE 1.5E+00.
001700 01  F4  COMP-2.
001800 01  S1  COMP-1 VALUE 0.
001900 01  W15 PIC S9(15) COMP-3 VALUE 15.
002000 01  D10 PIC S9(13) COMP-3 VALUE 10.
002100 01  P3  PIC S9(5)V9(3) COMP-3 VALUE 3.
002200 01  P7  PIC S9(5)V9(3) COMP-3 VALUE 7.
002300 01  Q2  PIC 9V99.
002400 01  I3  PIC S9(3).
002500 01  E3  PIC -999.
002600 01  R12 PIC -(3)9.9(12).
002700 01  FT.
002800     05  FE COMP-2 OCCURS 3 TIMES.
002900 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003000 MAIN-PARA.
003100     COMPUTE F4 = W15 / D10.  MOVE F4 TO R12.
003200     DISPLAY 'A 15/10 ->F     ' R12.
003300     DIVIDE W15 BY D10 GIVING F4.  MOVE F4 TO R12.
003400     DISPLAY 'B DIVIDE GIVING ' R12.
003500     COMPUTE F4 = W15 / D10 * 1.0.  MOVE F4 TO R12.
003600     DISPLAY 'C 15/10*1.0     ' R12.
003700     MOVE W15 TO F1.
003800     COMPUTE F4 = F1 / D10.  MOVE F4 TO R12.
003900     DISPLAY 'D F1(15)/D10    ' R12.
004000     COMPUTE F4 = F2 * (P3 / P7).  MOVE F4 TO R12.
004100     DISPLAY 'E F2*(P3/P7)    ' R12.
004200     COMPUTE F4 = P3 / P7 + 0.
004300     MOVE F4 TO R12.
004400     DISPLAY 'F P3/P7+0       ' R12.
004500     MOVE 2.5 TO F4.  MOVE F4 TO I3.  MOVE I3 TO E3.
004600     DISPLAY 'G 2.5 ->S9(3)   ' E3.
004700     MOVE -2.5 TO F4.  MOVE F4 TO I3.  MOVE I3 TO E3.
004800     DISPLAY 'H -2.5 ->S9(3)  ' E3.
004900     COMPUTE F4 = 2 / 3.  MOVE F4 TO Q2.
005000     DISPLAY 'I 2/3 -> 9V99   ' Q2.
005100     COMPUTE F4 = F2 / 2.25.  MOVE F4 TO Q2.
005200     DISPLAY 'J 1.5/2.25->9V99' Q2.
005300     COMPUTE F4 = F2 / 2.25.  MOVE F4 TO R12.
005400     DISPLAY 'K 1.5/2.25->R12 ' R12.
005500     MOVE 1500 TO F4.  MOVE F4 TO I3.  MOVE I3 TO E3.
005600     DISPLAY 'L 1500 ->S9(3)  ' E3.
005700     COMPUTE I3 ROUNDED = F2 / 2.25 * 10.  MOVE I3 TO E3.
005800     DISPLAY 'M ROUNDED 6.67  ' E3.
005900     COMPUTE I3 = F2 / 2.25 * 10.  MOVE I3 TO E3.
006000     DISPLAY 'N UNROUNDED     ' E3.
006100     MOVE 0.1 TO S1.
006200     DISPLAY 'O DISPLAY S1    ' S1.
006300     MOVE 1000 TO F4.
006400     DISPLAY 'P DISPLAY 1000  ' F4.
006500     MOVE 0.001 TO F4.
006600     DISPLAY 'Q DISPLAY 0.001 ' F4.
006700     MOVE 0 TO F4.
006800     DISPLAY 'R DISPLAY 0     ' F4.
006900     MOVE 123456789 TO F4.
007000     DISPLAY 'S DISPLAY 123.. ' F4.
007100     MOVE -0.5 TO F4.
007200     DISPLAY 'T DISPLAY -0.5  ' F4.
007300     MOVE 2.5 TO FE (2).
007400     DISPLAY 'U DISPLAY FE(2) ' FE (2).
007500     MOVE FE (2) TO F4.
007600     COMPUTE F4 = F4 ** 0.  MOVE F4 TO R12.
007700     DISPLAY 'V 2.5**0        ' R12.
007800     MOVE 0 TO F1.
007900     COMPUTE F4 = F1 ** 0.  MOVE F4 TO R12.
008000     DISPLAY 'W 0**0          ' R12.
008100     MOVE -8 TO F1.  MOVE 3 TO F2.
008200     COMPUTE F4 = F1 ** F2.  MOVE F4 TO R12.
008300     DISPLAY 'X -8**3         ' R12.
008400     MOVE 0.5 TO F2.
008500     COMPUTE F4 = F1 ** F2 ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY 'Y SIZE ERROR'.
008600     MOVE F4 TO R12.
008700     DISPLAY 'Y -8**0.5       ' R12.
008800     MOVE 0 TO F1.
008900     COMPUTE F4 = F2 / F1 ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY 'Z SIZE ERROR'.
009000     MOVE F4 TO R12.
009100     DISPLAY 'Z 0.5/0         ' R12.
009200     MOVE 1 TO F1.
009300     COMPUTE F4 = F1 / 3.  MOVE F4 TO R12.
009400     DISPLAY 'AA F1/3         ' R12.
009500     IF F4 < 0.34 DISPLAY 'AB F4 < 0.34 YES'
009600        ELSE DISPLAY 'AB F4 < 0.34 NO'.
009700     MOVE 7 TO F4.
009800     IF F4 = 7 DISPLAY 'AC F4 = 7 YES'
009900        ELSE DISPLAY 'AC F4 = 7 NO'.
010000     IF FE (2) > F2 DISPLAY 'AD FE(2) > F2 YES'
010100        ELSE DISPLAY 'AD FE(2) > F2 NO'.
010200     MOVE F2 TO S1.  MOVE S1 TO F4.  MOVE F4 TO R12.
010300     DISPLAY 'AE 0.5 via S1   ' R12.
010400     COMPUTE S1 = S1 * 3.  MOVE S1 TO R12.
010500     DISPLAY 'AF S1*3         ' R12.
010600     STOP RUN.
